type: software
title: "EDA Toolkit"
abstract: "A Python library of composable functions for exploratory data analysis: stratified descriptive tables (Table 1), batch outlier detection and normality testing, goodness-of-fit diagnostics, correlation matrices with significance testing, formatted Excel exports, and publication-ready visualizations."
